  "description": "Listed building consent for the use of property as live/work unit (Use Class&nbsp;Sui Generis) comprising art studio/gallery at ground floor with residential to the upper floors; associated internal and external alterations including restorations to the front elevation; erection of a mansard roof extension; and demolition of exiting and construction of a new outbuilding in the rear garden.",
